// Mensajes de operador / buzón que la transcripción puede atribuir al "usuario"
const IVR_RE = /(voice ?mail|leave (a|your) message|after the (tone|beep)|not available|unavailable|switched off|not reachable|out of (network|coverage)|is busy|busy on another call|please try (again )?later|number (you have )?(dialled|dialed|are calling)|does not exist|mailbox|record your message|कृपया|स्विच ऑफ|पहुंच से बाहर|व्यस्त|उपलब्ध नहीं|नेटवर्क क्षेत्र)/i;

